{0 neodriver_packstream}

Pure OCaml implementation of {b PackStream}, the binary serialization format
used by Neo4j's Bolt protocol. No async dependencies.

- {!module:Neodriver_packstream.Packstream} — [pack] / [unpack] with depth and
  size limits, and a safe error type.

The root {!module:Neodriver_packstream} exposes [Packstream].
